  "description": "<p>The response body mentions how a property is missing.  I would have expected it to mention the broader issue - that there is no message body. This is exceedingly minor, if a problem at all.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>{{curl -i -X POST --user fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H \"Memento-Datetime: Wed, 30 May 2018 23:02:44 GMT\" -H \"Content-Type: text/turtle\" <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/versioning/v9/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/versioning/v9/fcr:versions</a> }}</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><tt>HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request</tt><br/>\n<tt>Date: Wed, 29 Aug 2018 21:27:00 GMT</tt><br/>\n<tt>Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=yl6cm7f1tsp10bxdre0qlf7a;Path=/</tt><br/>\n<tt>Expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT</tt><br/>\n<tt>Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Tue, 28-Aug-2018 21:27:00 GMT</tt><br/>\n<tt>Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/static/constraints/ConstraintViolationException.rdf\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/static/constraints/ConstraintViolationException.rdf</a>&gt;; rel=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy\"</tt><br/>\n<tt>Content-Type: text/plain;charset=utf-8</tt><br/>\n<tt>Content-Length: 80</tt><br/>\n<tt>Server: Jetty(9.3.1.v20150714)</tt></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><tt>Missing required property <a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#createdBy\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#createdBy</a></tt></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>",
